ming pool","category":"Spaces"},"width":549,"height":823,"viewerOrder":155,"categories":[]},{"id":"photo-0f55f446f0178fab1163","enabled":true,"image":{"src":"/reference-gallery/0f55f446f0178fab1163.webp","alt":"Sunrise across beach parasols and the sea","category":"Spaces"},"width":976,"height":651,"caption":"description","viewerOrder":150,"categories":[]},{"id":"photo-d590838948e82e21fe07","enabled":true,"image":{"src":"/reference-gallery/d590838948e82e21fe07.webp","alt":"Lone palm and white beach umbrella","category":"Living"},"width":976,"height":651,"viewerOrder":142,"categories":["dining"]},{"id":"photo-8c4906a5234e09de7069","enabled":true,"image":{"src":"/reference-gallery/8c4906a5234e09de7069.webp","alt":"Patterned cushion and cane chair in a bungalow","category":"Spaces"},"width":549,"height":823,"viewerOrder":143,"categories":["bungalows"]},{"id":"photo-7c136d124bd3f72d86fb","enabled":true,"image":{"src":"/reference-gallery/7c136d124bd3f72d86fb.webp","alt":"White bungalow porch surrounded by flowers","category":"Spaces"},"width":549,"height":823,"viewerOrder":153,"categories":[]},{"id":"photo-e71106ec6e875202566f","enabled":true,"image":{"src":"/reference-gallery/e71106ec6e875202566f.webp","alt":"Balinese musicians playing gamelan","category":"Spaces"},"width":976,"height":651,"viewerOrder":145,"categories":[]},{"id":"photo-16edeb6333e7831e4797","enabled":true,"image":{"src":"/reference-gallery/16edeb6333e7831e4797.webp","alt":"Stone garden basin amid tropical plants","category":"Spaces"},"width":549,"height":823,"viewerOrder":149,"categories":[]},{"id":"photo-722252c241ca10c517f7","enabled":true,"image":{"src":"/reference-gallery/722252c241ca10c517f7.webp","alt":"Sunrise silhouettes of palms and a beach visitor","category":"Spaces"},"width":549,"height":823,"viewerOrder":148,"categories":[]},{"id":"photo-b61e9790c80c034c2773","enabled":true,"image":{"src":"/reference-gallery/b61e9790c80c034c2773.webp","alt":"Living room with polished wood floor and open windows","category":"Spaces"},"width":549,"height":823,"viewerOrder":156,"categories":["bungalows"]},{"id":"photo-57ae197b044192338acf","enabled":true,"image":{"src":"/reference-gallery/57ae197b044192338acf.webp","alt":"Framed painting on a stone wall beside a palm","category":"Spaces"},"width":549,"height":823,"viewerOrder":154,"categories":[]}]},"amenities":["Private pool","Daily breakfast","Garden living","Thoughtful service","Fast Wi-Fi","Airport transfer"],"rooms":[{"id":"rooms-village-bungalow","slug":"village-bungalow","title":"Village Bungalow","description":"Our Village Bungalows, which comprise sixteen large, charming cottages, are some of the first structures designed by Pak Wija. They are inspired by traditional Balinese architecture, with a thatched roof and cool, air-conditioned interiors.","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/ec7335ef6b985507.webp","alt":"Village Bungalow","category":"Spaces"},"capacity":2,"area":45,"facilities":["Cotton shirt, sarong & sun hat","Bathub","Hairdryer","Minibar","Safety deposit box","Tea/coffee maker","Telephone","Wifi"],"inclusions":["Daily ala carte Breakfast in the seaside restaurant","Two bottles of water provided in the room complimentary  daily","Cold towel upon arrival","Welcome drink at the beachfront bar"],"signature":{"hero":{"src":"/reference-rooms/1cf3dd4a833ce838.webp","alt":"Village Bungalow exterior","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Our Village Bungalows, which comprise sixteen large, charming cottages, are some of the first structures designed by Pak Wija. They are inspired by traditional Balinese architecture, with a thatched roof and cool, air-conditioned interiors.","body":["Each group of four bungalows is arranged in a configuration resembling the Hindu cosmic wheel, connected at the center to a vintage balé kulkul tower.   The spacious bedroom and living area includes a king-sized bed and two sofas that can convert into single beds. The large bathroom leads to an outdoor shower in a secluded courtyard garden. The outsized bathtub presides between the indoor and outdoor spaces. As you lie back and soak in the tub, you can gaze through the glass wall into your private garden and view Bali’s tropical sky.","All Village Bungalows are set within a landscaped garden, with a Balinese-style lounging pavilion or balé. The flooring features a variety of handmade ceramic tile types and colors, including red, blue, and terracotta batik tiles, alongside terrazzo flooring."],"showcase":{"wide":{"src":"/reference-rooms/b74dfb6ea4937b20.webp","alt":"Village Bungalow bedroom","category":"Spaces"},"small":{"src":"/reference-rooms/bab9c99758e81319.webp","alt":"Village Bungalow architectural detail","category":"Spaces"},"tall":{"src":"/reference-rooms/2cacc9efe2fe34c7.webp","alt":"Village Bungalow living space","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Each room at Tandjung Sari has its own unique charm.","body":"The pictures depicted here illustrate the bungalow type mentioned, though you may book this bungalow type and experience a unit with slightly different attributes."},"gallery":[{"id":"photograph-1","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/6ca1d72b3a14640c.webp","alt":"Village Bungalow bath and courtyard","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-2","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/b0d387542915b5fb.webp","alt":"Village Bungalow bedroom and sitting area","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-3","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/056459f37aa38390.webp","alt":"Village Bungalow garden pavilion","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-4","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/5a0ce4c5054af599.webp","alt":"Village Bungalow interior living space","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-5","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/5d935dc09dd6b150.webp","alt":"Village Bungalow bathroom","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-6","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/86c038b9ea9bcf87.webp","alt":"Village Bungalow terrace","category":"Spaces"}}]}},{"id":"rooms-two-storey-bungalow","slug":"two-storey-bungalow","title":"Two-Storey Bungalow","description":"Tucked away in its own garden with a spacious terrace and polished wooden interiors.","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/8ef1d619416ca0d3.webp","alt":"Two-Storey Bungalow","category":"Spaces"},"capacity":2,"area":50,"facilities":["Cotton shirt, sarong & sun hat","Bathub","Hairdryer","Minibar","Safety deposit box","Tea/Coffee Maker","Telephone","Wifi"],"inclusions":["Daily ala carte Breakfast in the seaside restaurant","Two bottles of water provided in the room complimentary daily","Cold towel upon arrival","Welcome drink at the beachfront bar"],"signature":{"hero":{"src":"/reference-rooms/8ef1d619416ca0d3.webp","alt":"Two-Storey Bungalow exterior","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Our four two-storey bungalows are tucked away, each in its own gardens. Each bungalow has a spacious terrace and polished wooden interiors.","body":["Step up to the upper-level living areas, which have windows on three sides, maximizing natural light and garden views.  The ground floor—three units with polished timber floors and the other one with terrazzo tiles—houses a queen-sized canopied bed and a bathroom complete with a handmade terrazzo tub, big enough for two.","Exposed brick, a quirky stone relief, and the antique carved wooden door and windows visually enrich the veranda, which frames a serene private garden."],"showcase":{"wide":{"src":"/reference-rooms/c66840c00ba7f017.webp","alt":"Two-Storey Bungalow bedroom","category":"Spaces"},"small":{"src":"/reference-rooms/1b0f72cae92311be.webp","alt":"Two-Storey Bungalow architectural detail","category":"Spaces"},"tall":{"src":"/reference-rooms/aa3f826d15d55a73.webp","alt":"Two-Storey Bungalow living space","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Each room at Tandjung Sari has its own unique charm.","body":"The pictures depicted here illustrate the bungalow type mentioned, though you may book this bungalow type and experience a unit with slightly different attributes."},"gallery":[{"id":"photograph-1","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/ff894b463c129757.webp","alt":"Two-Storey Bungalow bath and courtyard","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-2","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/61bd4d69a6f267a0.webp","alt":"Two-Storey Bungalow bedroom and sitting area","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-3","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/a315917ce861decc.webp","alt":"Two-Storey Bungalow garden pavilion","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-4","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/00a489def911becd.webp","alt":"Two-Storey Bungalow interior living space","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-5","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/a0f5a09a8779ad3c.webp","alt":"Two-Storey Bungalow bathroom","category":"Spaces"}}]}},{"id":"rooms-beachfront-bungalow","slug":"beachfront-bungalow","title":"Beachfront Bungalow","description":"Nestled in a beachside garden, this cozy retreat offers sea views from an upstairs loft.","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/4f9f73343b2638ac.webp","alt":"Beachfront Bungalow","category":"Spaces"},"capacity":2,"area":55,"facilities":["Cotton shirt, sarong & sun hat","Bathub","Hairdryer","Minibar","Safety deposit box","Tea/Coffee Maker","Telephone","Wifi"],"inclusions":["Daily ala carte Breakfast in the seaside restaurant","Two bottles of water provided in the room complimentary daily","Cold towel upon arrival","Welcome drink at the beachfront bar"],"signature":{"hero":{"src":"/reference-rooms/c53a8138d8de844b.webp","alt":"Beachfront Bungalow exterior","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Discover the barefoot glamour of our two sanctuaries closest to the beach.","body":["The façade reflects the beauty of traditional Balinese architecture, set within a flourishing beachside courtyard, while the hardwood and bamboo materials deepen your connection to nature. You enter the ground-floor bedroom—one bungalow with a wooden floor and the other with terracotta tile—through an antique Balinese doorway.","The ground floor also features an indoor bathroom and an outdoor shower.  Ascend the spiral staircase to the upper level, where you’ll feel embraced by the treetops. The classic veranda invites you to unwind and enjoy the sights and sounds of the seaside garden."],"showcase":{"wide":{"src":"/reference-rooms/0420b46dffa9e3d8.webp","alt":"Beachfront Bungalow bedroom","category":"Spaces"},"small":{"src":"/reference-rooms/602538ad829201de.webp","alt":"Beachfront Bungalow architectural detail","category":"Spaces"},"tall":{"src":"/reference-rooms/6adff473b5bd13bc.webp","alt":"Beachfront Bungalow living space","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Each room at Tandjung Sari has its own unique charm.","body":"The pictures depicted here illustrate the bungalow type mentioned, though you may book this bungalow type and experience a unit with slightly different attributes."},"gallery":[{"id":"photograph-1","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/915686a353285631.webp","alt":"Beachfront Bungalow bath and courtyard","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-2","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/4c4d8ad6c46f0060.webp","alt":"Beachfront Bungalow bedroom and sitting area","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-3","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/9dab833fe1a11072.webp","alt":"Beachfront Bungalow garden pavilion","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-4","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/4af3e7415895ec81.webp","alt":"Beachfront Bungalow interior living space","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-5","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/88fc45a60c9a34d9.webp","alt":"Beachfront Bungalow bathroom","category":"Spaces"}}]}},{"id":"rooms-south-garden-bungalow","slug":"south-garden-bungalow","title":"South Garden Bungalow","description":"The spacious bedroom with canopied queen bed has a large work table and a day bed, ideal for reading.","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/37ad0a13d67c51f6.webp","alt":"South Garden Bungalow","category":"Spaces"},"capacity":2,"area":128,"facilities":["Cotton shirt, sarong & sun hat","Bathub","Hairdryer","Minibar","Safety deposit box","Tea/Coffee Maker","Telephone","Wifi"],"inclusions":["Daily ala carte Breakfast in the seaside restaurant","Two bottles of water provided in the room complimentary daily","Cold towel upon arrival","Welcome drink at the beachfront bar"],"signature":{"hero":{"src":"/reference-rooms/37ad0a13d67c51f6.webp","alt":"South Garden Bungalow exterior","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"The four inviting units of the South Garden Bungalows are a new generation of bungalows with traditional roofs and sleek interiors—a descriptive intersection between vintage and modern.","body":["Two bungalows boast thatched roofs adorned with blue batik tiles and outdoor bathtubs, while the others feature wood shingle roofs complemented by green celadon batik tiles and indoor bathtubs. Stroll through the gardens and discover the traditionally proportioned veranda, graced with carved wooden pillars, a kamasan painting, and carefully curated antique windows and doors—each element profoundly telling a story of the Tandjung Sari experience.","Inside, spacious bedrooms welcome you with a canopied queen bed, a generous work table and a daybed, ideal for reading. Each bungalow offers a decent bathroom and dressing area, equipped with twin vanity sinks, double wardrobe closets, and an indoor shower with seating. Step beyond the door to uncover an outdoor shower with a refreshing rain showerhead."],"showcase":{"wide":{"src":"/reference-rooms/32e09ec5f44e03cd.webp","alt":"South Garden Bungalow bedroom","category":"Spaces"},"small":{"src":"/reference-rooms/c918e73a55924d26.webp","alt":"South Garden Bungalow architectural detail","category":"Spaces"},"tall":{"src":"/reference-rooms/f855bc9c1e6649eb.webp","alt":"South Garden Bungalow living space","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Each room at Tandjung Sari has its own unique charm.","body":"The pictures depicted here illustrate the bungalow type mentioned, though you may book this bungalow type and experience a unit with slightly different attributes."},"gallery":[{"id":"photograph-1","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/63dd944a232d9ee5.webp","alt":"South Garden Bungalow bath and courtyard","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-2","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/ac796aeefb254c6f.webp","alt":"South Garden Bungalow bedroom and sitting area","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-3","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/bb008ddbb7268e74.webp","alt":"South Garden Bungalow garden pavilion","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-4","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/9b51273f484e109a.webp","alt":"South Garden Bungalow interior living space","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-5","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/5c374843b8fd1a6c.webp","alt":"South Garden Bungalow bathroom","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-6","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/f24d883d475f62e9.webp","alt":"South Garden Bungalow terrace","category":"Spaces"}}]}},{"id":"rooms-garden-seaview-bungalow","slug":"garden-seaview-bungalow","title":"Garden Seaview Bungalow","description":"Charming bungalow in a secluded garden, with a spacious veranda and views to the sea.","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/50294ef5a663cd15.webp","alt":"Garden Seaview Bungalow","category":"Spaces"},"capacity":2,"area":70,"facilities":["Cotton shirt, sarong & sun hat","Bathub","Hairdryer","Minibar","Safety deposit box","Tea/Coffee maker","Telephone","Wifi"],"inclusions":["Daily ala carte Breakfast in the seaside restaurant","Two bottles of water provided in the room complimentary daily","Cold towel upon arrival","Welcome drink at the beachfront bar"],"signature":{"hero":{"src":"/reference-rooms/50294ef5a663cd15.webp","alt":"Garden Seaview Bungalow exterior","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Explore and encounter the soul of the Garden Seaview Bungalow #24 — a unique bungalow with its own secluded leafy garden, spacious airy veranda, and front-on-ocean vistas.","body":["This bungalow captivates with its antique entry door. As you enter, you will be delighted with the warmth of the terracotta-colored batik tiles. Further, you will notice the ivory oval indoor bathtub complemented by an indoor shower and a classic modern dressing table.","The backyard features a tropical outdoor shower, for bathing in the midst of nature. Each carefully curated piece of furniture, artwork, and ornament infuses the space with a quiet spell."],"showcase":{"wide":{"src":"/reference-rooms/75604cc478c7e300.webp","alt":"Garden Seaview Bungalow bedroom","category":"Spaces"},"small":{"src":"/reference-rooms/74b7782a47890edd.webp","alt":"Garden Seaview Bungalow architectural detail","category":"Spaces"},"tall":{"src":"/reference-rooms/8d8a081dcc581a90.webp","alt":"Garden Seaview Bungalow living space","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Each room at Tandjung Sari has its own unique charm.","body":"The pictures depicted here illustrate the bungalow type mentioned, though you may book this bungalow type and experience a unit with slightly different attributes."},"gallery":[{"id":"photograph-1","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/8059441e5e122b08.webp","alt":"Garden Seaview Bungalow bath and courtyard","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-2","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/19629064fd905164.webp","alt":"Garden Seaview Bungalow bedroom and sitting area","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-3","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/8a365dacce5af6af.webp","alt":"Garden Seaview Bungalow garden pavilion","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-4","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/2679a71afa843ae2.webp","alt":"Garden Seaview Bungalow interior living space","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-5","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/c09d6c04ed64fffc.webp","alt":"Garden Seaview Bungalow bathroom","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-6","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/4f6a3ae37818944d.webp","alt":"Garden Seaview Bungalow terrace","category":"Spaces"}}]}},{"id":"rooms-family-bungalow","slug":"family-bungalow","title":"Family Bungalow","description":"The Family Bungalows are designed to provide a cozy getaway for families in Sanur, offering comfort and tranquility with interconnected sleeping areas, terraces, and gardens. Each bungalow features two bedrooms: one with a queen-sized bed and another with two twin beds.","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/23cc47b4582b9331.webp","alt":"Family Bungalow","category":"Spaces"},"capacity":4,"area":135,"facilities":["Cotton shirt, sarong & sun hat","Bathub","Hairdryer","Minibar","Safety deposit box","Tea/Coffee Maker","Telephone","Wifi"],"inclusions":["Daily ala carte Breakfast in the seaside restaurant","Two bottles of water provided in the room complimentary daily","Cold towel upon arrival","Welcome drink at the beachfront bar"],"signature":{"hero":{"src":"/reference-rooms/4ad25185c5b1d69a.webp","alt":"Family Bungalow exterior","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"The Family Bungalows are designed to provide a cozy getaway for families in Sanur, offering comfort and tranquility with interconnected sleeping areas, terraces, and gardens.","body":["Each bungalow features two bedrooms: one with a queen-sized bed and another with two twin beds. These rooms embody the unique style of Tandjung Sari while showcasing their own individual character.","As you approach the bungalows, you will notice a Kamasan painting displayed above the door. Inside, the bungalows are adorned with a light green color scheme and batik floor tiles. Each bungalow also includes a family bathtub overlooking the backyard garden, along with outdoor showers."],"showcase":{"wide":{"src":"/reference-rooms/5019670d82b75845.webp","alt":"Family Bungalow bedroom","category":"Spaces"},"small":{"src":"/reference-rooms/6bcbcf2239194086.webp","alt":"Family Bungalow architectural detail","category":"Spaces"},"tall":{"src":"/reference-rooms/bf121188e08e15d3.webp","alt":"Family Bungalow living space","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Each room at Tandjung Sari has its own unique charm.","body":"The pictures depicted here illustrate the bungalow type mentioned, though you may book this bungalow type and experience a unit with slightly different attributes."},"gallery":[{"id":"photograph-1","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/7ebd7680a137cf0a.webp","alt":"Family Bungalow bath and courtyard","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-2","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/2ebac394a22d2490.webp","alt":"Family Bungalow bedroom and sitting area","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-3","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/5b8285feef0af434.webp","alt":"Family Bungalow garden pavilion","category":"Spaces"}},{"id":"photograph-4","image":{"src":"/reference-rooms/f5adda664a784d5e.webp","alt":"Family Bungalow interior living space","category":"Spaces"}}]}}],"signatureRooms":{"title":"Our Rooms","hero":{"src":"/reference-story/hero-image-bungalow-resizedjpg.jpeg","alt":"Aerial photograph of Tandjung Sari bungalows","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Tandjung Sari is a handmade resort. The resorts \"rooms\" are stand-alone cottages—always called bungalows—set in walled gardens.","smallImage":{"src":"/reference-rooms/df530c83448f8ad2.webp","alt":"Handmade Village Bungalow interior","category":"Spaces"},"smallCopy":"Local craftsmen constructed them organically, showcasing the resort's distinctive handmade character in its architecture, interiors, and furnishings.","largeImage":{"src":"/reference-rooms/05367bbc53f7f29a.webp","alt":"Traditional carved gateway at Tandjung Sari","category":"Spaces"},"largeCopy":"These bungalows are thoughtfully placed throughout the property and were beautifully designed based on a sketch by the founder, Wija Wawo-Runtu.","ornament":{"src":"/reference-rooms/listing-ornament.svg","alt":"Coral ornament","category":"Spaces"}},"modules":{"dining":true,"experiences":true,"packages":true,"terms":true},"dining":{"title":"Culinary","description":"The Restaurant at Tandjung Sari offers you more than a seaside dining experience. You may choose to dine in the airy wantilan pavilion amongst Indonesian antiques or on the wooden deck under the shady camplung trees near the bar area, right on Sanur Beach. Our homemade cuisine reflects our passion for authentic local and international food, accompanied by specially crafted drinks. Open every day, from 6.30am to 11pm.","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/a0cdcf1d52648a3898dc.webp","alt":"Dining illustrated Balinese village","category":"Spaces"},"bookingUrl":"https://example.com/dining","signature":{"introTitle":"The Restaurant at Tandjung Sari","categories":[{"id":"breakfast","enabled":true,"title":"Breakfast","description":"Sanur, the \"Morning of the World,\" unveils a breathtaking moment when the sun rises, casting a golden glow on the sand and igniting the sky with color—a true masterpiece of nature. There are countless ways to start the day, but is there a better way than to savor breakfast while witnessing a natural wonder?","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/08038031e1c9a5f9d48f.webp","alt":"Breakfast","category":"Spaces"},"menuPages":[{"id":"breakfast-page-1","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/2a40a45176a72df0f947.webp","alt":"Breakfast menu page 1","category":"Spaces"},"width":2044,"height":2892},{"id":"breakfast-page-2","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/326fb61058fa95492bbd.webp","alt":"Breakfast menu page 2","category":"Spaces"},"width":2044,"height":2892},{"id":"breakfast-page-3","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/5a5b0cb2e49bf92bfa58.webp","alt":"Breakfast menu page 3","category":"Spaces"},"width":2044,"height":2892}],"mobileMenuPages":[{"id":"breakfast-mobile-page-1","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/2a40a45176a72df0f947.webp","alt":"Breakfast mobile menu page 1","category":"Spaces"},"width":2044,"height":2892},{"id":"breakfast-mobile-page-2","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/6b7994f03543d42c649a.webp","alt":"Breakfast mobile menu page 2","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"breakfast-mobile-page-3","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/12c2f1dad84004dcf165.webp","alt":"Breakfast mobile menu page 3","category":"Spaces"},"width":1911,"height":3100},{"id":"breakfast-mobile-page-4","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/ac51c616c72b18737e62.webp","alt":"Breakfast mobile menu page 4","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"breakfast-mobile-page-5","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/466218676adaad5b0931.webp","alt":"Breakfast mobile menu page 5","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550}],"downloadUrl":""},{"id":"all-day-dining","enabled":true,"title":"All Day Dining","description":"Ever since our founder established Tandjung Sari as a family home, food has held equal importance to accommodation. Today, we continue to uphold the principles of home cooking. Created from fresh, locally grown produce and ingredients, we offer signature authentic local and international cuisine.","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/bb606c5e0861898c03c3.webp","alt":"All Day Dining","category":"Spaces"},"menuPages":[{"id":"all-day-dining-page-1","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/19fb1a774784a436926c.webp","alt":"All Day Dining menu page 1","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"all-day-dining-page-2","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/d1c764ed999f94b20b48.webp","alt":"All Day Dining menu page 2","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"all-day-dining-page-3","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/d5ecbf5b29ee1be7f2d1.webp","alt":"All Day Dining menu page 3","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"all-day-dining-page-4","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/396db0c7f2d9b6854ed3.webp","alt":"All Day Dining menu page 4","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446}],"mobileMenuPages":[{"id":"all-day-dining-mobile-page-1","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/4a2e0e638209b074b832.webp","alt":"All Day Dining mobile menu page 1","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"all-day-dining-mobile-page-2","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/7ae21801d46892e134ca.webp","alt":"All Day Dining mobile menu page 2","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"all-day-dining-mobile-page-3","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/1d80ffc9713f056df173.webp","alt":"All Day Dining mobile menu page 3","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"all-day-dining-mobile-page-4","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/0a520d9884f1a4026d4a.webp","alt":"All Day Dining mobile menu page 4","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"all-day-dining-mobile-page-5","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/98fe51403f3f25d94205.webp","alt":"All Day Dining mobile menu page 5","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"all-day-dining-mobile-page-6","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/0fcf9ed4a8a21170fd69.webp","alt":"All Day Dining mobile menu page 6","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550}],"downloadUrl":""},{"id":"drinks","enabled":true,"title":"Drinks & Wines","description":"Tandjung Sari's beachfront bar is the ultimate place to gather at all hours of the day. The bar menu offers a hand-picked selection of refreshments with fresh tropical flavors—whether soft, sweet, or a bit stronger. Contact us to explore our selection of wines and take advantage of special offers designed for wine enthusiasts.","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/2486277bb07cc788020e.webp","alt":"Drinks & Wines","category":"Spaces"},"menuPages":[{"id":"drinks-page-1","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/f7c87a41940942f0d53e.webp","alt":"Drinks menu page 1","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"drinks-page-2","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/b8832502fd02e55e5ecc.webp","alt":"Drinks menu page 2","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"drinks-page-3","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/4dafd3a63b5d8d1d342c.webp","alt":"Drinks menu page 3","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"drinks-page-4","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/edbf639be2ea6f666460.webp","alt":"Drinks menu page 4","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"drinks-page-5","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/c1fde131d877e164cce8.webp","alt":"Drinks menu page 5","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"drinks-page-6","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/00a6b49c253d0ed50286.webp","alt":"Drinks menu page 6","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"drinks-page-7","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/73f241b2151b03d72e65.webp","alt":"Drinks menu page 7","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"drinks-page-8","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/f3a89616869e4cd06694.webp","alt":"Drinks menu page 8","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"drinks-page-9","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/6a96f390a219c9dbdd43.webp","alt":"Drinks menu page 9","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"drinks-page-10","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/c4792e060ed6e38f72a4.webp","alt":"Drinks menu page 10","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"drinks-page-11","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/fa3b0b775885e29148f5.webp","alt":"Drinks menu page 11","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446},{"id":"drinks-page-12","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/d1bf2a5d20747b3017ae.webp","alt":"Drinks menu page 12","category":"Spaces"},"width":1022,"height":1446}],"mobileMenuPages":[{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-1","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/6233954714a7c9b4b398.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 1","category":"Spaces"},"width":1333,"height":2162},{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-2","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/ddd44badb92cdf061c53.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 2","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-3","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/2ed1cb1d7af497c08ff8.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 3","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-4","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/a82d5dd4941630f1d0eb.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 4","category":"Spaces"},"width":956,"height":1550},{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-5","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/85657d4d01707b3da509.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 5","category":"Spaces"},"width":956,"height":1550},{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-6","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/f57811019926fe19f25d.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 6","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-7","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/95f462e051d329d0ae36.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 7","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-8","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/d56ac82bf1acc8b59fb7.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 8","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-9","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/e578710cf00d2db7d421.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 9","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-10","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/a5c5125038a9b11d6cc5.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 10","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-11","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/3924eff6e62f59e5abc5.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 11","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-12","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/3924eff6e62f59e5abc5.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 12","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550},{"id":"drinks-mobile-page-13","image":{"src":"/reference-dining/4ac27e5a23ed5463d7d8.webp","alt":"Drinks mobile menu page 13","category":"Spaces"},"width":955,"height":1550}],"downloadUrl":""}],"offers":[{"id":"afternoon-tea","enabled":true,"title":"Afternoon Tea","description":["Relishing tea is a deep, personal ritual that allows one to connect with oneself and life's moments. Offered in Indonesian style, we invite you to wind up your afternoon luxuriating in an assortment of sweet and savory local traditional jajan presented on a three-tier stand.","Please note that a one-day advance booking is essential."],"image":{"src":"/reference-dining/4ccc3453e11a97ce2776.webp","alt":"Afternoon Tea","category":"Spaces"},"reservationUrl":""},{"id":"mini-rijsttafel","enabled":true,"title":"Mini Rijsttafel","description":["The traditional rijsttafel is a study of Indonesian regional dishes and Balinese flair for presentation. It features a vast array of local fare to accompany rice—fish, fowl, beef, eggs, and vegetables, each prepared in varied ways to highlight rich flavor, color, and texture.","Perfect for two."],"image":{"src":"/reference-dining/a15b21f409205ab46a0e.webp","alt":"Mini Rijsttafel","category":"Spaces"},"reservationUrl":""},{"id":"private-gathering","enabled":true,"title":"Private Gathering","description":["For 10 people or more.","Serene Sanur Beach in the Tandjung Sari style creates an idyllic place for being together. If you prefer a more tailored dining experience to gather with your loved ones, we would be delighted to accommodate you.","Choose from one of our beachside living room areas and enjoy a selection of home-cooked dishes and refreshments."],"image":{"src":"/reference-dining/fa74697b9cc345db1d45.webp","alt":"Private Gathering","category":"Spaces"},"reservationUrl":""},{"id":"romantic-dinner","enabled":true,"title":"Romantic Dinner","description":["We believe in the magic of crafting happy memories. Tandjung Sari's\nintimate beachside dinner offers specially arranged four-course options\ncomplemented with a bottle of house wine. The ambiance is enriched with fresh\ntropical flowers, setting the stage for a memorable experience."],"image":{"src":"/reference-dining/237b43813aef982de60e.webp","alt":"Romantic Dinner","category":"Spaces"},"reservationUrl":""}],"notes":["Vegan","Vegetarian by Request","If you have any dietary restrictions or allergies, please inform the order taker.","All prices are in thousands of Indonesian Rupiah and 21% government tax and service charge to be added."]}},"experiences":[{"id":"experiences-island-mornings","slug":"island-mornings","title":"Island mornings","description":"Follow the paths through green rice fields and discover a quieter side of Bali. Ask your host about a personal itinerary.","image":{"src":"/images/nature.jpg","alt":"Sunlight over a Balinese landscape","category":"Nature"}},{"id":"experiences-by-the-sea","slug":"by-the-sea","title":"A day by the sea","description":"Salt in the air, sand beneath your feet. Take the scenic route to the coast and leave the afternoon open.","image":{"src":"/images/beach.jpg","alt":"A quiet tropical shoreline under a blue sky","category":"Nature"}}],"packages":[{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon","enabled":true,"slug":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon","title":"Seaside Wedding & Honeymoon","description":"Celebrate and reignite your romance with a three-night stay, highlighted by a magical candlelit dinner on the beach.","image":{"src":"/reference-packages/1c8f518892c6a160ce56.webp","alt":"Seaside Wedding & Honeymoon reference photograph","category":"Living","focalPoint":{"x":50,"y":50}},"signature":{"destination":"detail","enquiry":{"type":"external","url":"https://example.com/"},"referenceDemo":true,"sections":[{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-introduction","enabled":true,"layout":"intro","heading":"Love flourishes on the enchanting island of Bali, where the serene beauty of the Tandjung Sari seaside offers an unforgettable escape for honeymooners.","stayInfo":"Two nights stay at Village Bungalow for bride & groom","price":{"label":"Start From","currency":"IDR","amount":49410,"display":"IDR 49,410 for 20 guests","guestCount":20},"durationNights":2,"body":[],"small":{"src":"/reference-packages/e9dbcc2476af045a25a6.webp","alt":"Seaside Wedding & Honeymoon ceremonial detail","category":"Living","focalPoint":{"x":50,"y":50}},"wide":{"src":"/reference-packages/38113a72a0b4b47fcdad.webp","alt":"Seaside Wedding & Honeymoon supporting photograph","category":"Living","focalPoint":{"x":50,"y":50}}},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-rows-0","enabled":true,"layout":"inclusions","title":"Package Inclusion","entries":[{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-1","enabled":true,"text":"Five hours exclusive use of wedding venue: beach Area and few other optional areas"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-2","enabled":true,"text":"Buffet wedding dinner for 20 people with standard dinner set from selected menu"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-3","enabled":true,"text":"Twenty chairs with small cornflower shower"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-4","enabled":true,"text":"Traditional Balinese Rindik music during your ceremony"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-5","enabled":true,"text":"Four-poster bamboo gate with Balinese decoration"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-6","enabled":true,"text":"An altar table with flower arrangements"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-7","enabled":true,"text":"Six white flags of umbul-umbul"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-8","enabled":true,"text":"Four tall white Balinese umbrellas"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-9","enabled":true,"text":"Twenty decorative candles in the banana trunk cover"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-10","enabled":true,"text":"Four standing tropical flower arrangements"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-11","enabled":true,"text":"2000pcs virginal walk of flower petals"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-12","enabled":true,"text":"A standard tropical flower bridal bouquet"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-13","enabled":true,"text":"Two standard tropical flower buttonhole corsages"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-14","enabled":true,"text":"Twice glasses of house-local sparkling wine"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-15","enabled":true,"text":"One glass of mocktail upon guest arrival at the wedding venue"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-16","enabled":true,"text":"Two nights stay at Village Bungalow for bride & groom, inclusive of daily breakfast"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-17","enabled":true,"text":"A romantic dinner for the couple featuring one bottle of house-imported red or white wine"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-18","enabled":true,"text":"Wedding amenities in the Bungalow"},{"id":"seaside-wedding-and-honeymoon-row-0-19","enabled":true,"text":"21% government tax and service charge included"}]}]}},{"id":"hideaway-stay","enabled":true,"slug":"hideaway-stay","title":"Hideaway stay","description":"Reconnect with the soothing sea breeze and let the gentle waves of Sanur Beach nourish your body, mind, and spirit.","image":{"src":"/reference-packages/32032341633a0e03556f.webp","alt":"Hideaway stay reference photograph","category":"Living","focalPoint":{"x":50,"y":50}},"signature":{"destination":"detail","enquiry":{"type":"external","url":"https://example.com/"},"referenceDemo":true,"sections":[{"id":"hideaway-stay-introduction","enabled":true,"layout":"intro","heading":"Embrace the opportunity to escape the everyday and indulge in a three-day, two-night stay at our seaside sanctuary.","stayInfo":"3d/2n stay in a Village Bungalow","price":{"label":"Start From","currency":"IDR","amount":8740000,"display":"Rp. 8.740.000"},"durationNights":2,"body":[],"small":{"src":"/reference-packages/fa3d6bc2e5bad81e3de4.webp","alt":"Hideaway stay ceremonial detail","category":"Living","focalPoint":{"x":50,"y":50}},"wide":{"src":"/reference-packages/4ce6c61e028441f74921.webp","alt":"Hideaway stay supporting photograph","category":"Living","focalPoint":{"x":50,"y":50}}},{"id":"hideaway-stay-rows-0","enabled":true,"layout":"inclusions","title":"Package Inclusion","entries":[{"id":"hideaway-stay-row-0-1","enabled":true,"text":"3d/2n stay in a Village Bungalow"},{"id":"hideaway-stay-row-0-2","enabled":true,"text":"Return airport transfer"},{"id":"hideaway-stay-row-0-3","enabled":true,"text":"Cold towel upon arrival"},{"id":"hideaway-stay-row-0-4","enabled":true,"text":"Welcome drink at the beachfront bar"},{"id":"hideaway-stay-row-0-5","enabled":true,"text":"Two complimentary bottles of mineral water daily in your room"},{"id":"hideaway-stay-row-0-6","enabled":true,"text":"Daily à la carte breakfast at the seaside restaurant"},{"id":"hideaway-stay-row-0-7","enabled":true,"text":"Complimentary use of a cotton shirt, sunhat, and sarong during your stay"},{"id":"hideaway-stay-row-0-8","enabled":true,"text":"Free internet access"},{"id":"hideaway-stay-row-0-9","enabled":true,"text":"Applicable government tax and service charge (21% included)"}]},{"id":"hideaway-stay-rows-1","enabled":true,"layout":"terms","title":"Bungalow upgrade additional charge","entries":[{"id":"hideaway-stay-row-1-1","enabled":true,"text":"IDR 300.000/night for Two Storey/Garden Sea View"},{"id":"hideaway-stay-row-1-2","enabled":true,"text":"IDR 600.000/night for Beach Bungalow"},{"id":"hideaway-stay-row-1-3","enabled":true,"text":"IDR 1,500,000/night for South Garden Bungalow"}]}]}},{"id":"stay-and-dine","enabled":true,"slug":"stay-and-dine","title":"Stay & Dine","description":"Experience Sanur's unpretentious hidden gem with its gentle sound of the sea in the culinary adventure of Tandjung Sari's signature Mini Rijsttafel dinner for two.","image":{"src":"/reference-packages/150765138429244c6e40.webp","alt":"Stay & Dine reference photograph","category":"Living","focalPoint":{"x":50,"y":50}},"signature":{"destination":"detail","enquiry":{"type":"external","url":"https://example.com/"},"referenceDemo":true,"sections":[{"id":"stay-and-dine-introduction","enabled":true,"layout":"intro","heading":"This four-day, three-night experience is crafted for passionate travelers and food lovers alike.","stayInfo":"4D/3N stay at Village Bungalow","durationNights":3,"body":[],"small":{"src":"/reference-packages/606829a36af98f81f8ed.webp","alt":"Stay & Dine ceremonial detail","category":"Living","focalPoint":{"x":50,"y":50}},"wide":{"src":"/reference-packages/3d726de09a9357287586.webp","alt":"Stay & Dine supporting photograph","category":"Living","focalPoint":{"x":50,"y":50}}},{"id":"stay-and-dine-rows-0","enabled":t